  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d0dde522f65134a981f8db6f1ac5aebe5108510a68c758df909f765f209687bd.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\nleft{ {( {1 - (2)/({15)}} ) + (2)/(5)} right} ÷ frac{{14}}{{15}} + ( {(2)/(3)of(6)/(7) ÷ (4)/(9) - (1)/(6) × 1(5)/(7)} )\n\n⇒ {(1 – 2/15) + 2/5} ÷ 14/15 + (2/3 of 6/7 ÷ 4/9 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ {(1 – 2/15) + 2/5} ÷ 14/15 + (4/7 ÷ 4/9 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ {(15 – 2)/15 + 2/5} ÷ 14/15 + (4/7 ÷ 4/9 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ {13/15 + 2/5} ÷ 14/15 + (4/7 ÷ 4/9 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ {(13 + 6)/15} ÷ 14/15 + (4/7 ÷ 4/9 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ 19/15 ÷ 14/15 + (4/7 ÷ 4/9 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ 19/15 × 15/14 + (9/7 – 1/6 × 12/7)\n\n⇒ 19/14 + (9/7 – 2/7)\n\n⇒ (19/14 + 1)\n\n⇒ (19 + 14)/14\n\n⇒ 33/14\n\n**∴ The required value is 33/14**\n\n1",
